    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 56 Ferndale Drive comprises an attractive three bedroomed end of terrace house and is an ideal purchase for someone looking for a comfortable home in a central location close to all amenities. \n\nThe property is located in Ferndale Drive not far from Wexford Town Centre and close to all amenities with a selection of primary and secondary schools located close by along with local shopping and lesiure facilities. \n\nThe accommodation, which is bright and well proportioned comprises Ent Hall, Reception Room, Kitchen/Dining Room to the ground floor with Three Bedrooms and a Bathroom. \nServices include all mains and dual central heating (oil fired and solid fuel).\n\nNo. 56 Ferndale Park would make an ideal first time buy or investment property and early viewing is recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Porch - c.1.3m x c.0.9m\n\n\nHallway - c.1.8m x c3.7m\n\n\nReception Room - c.3.5m x c.3.9m\nOpen fireplace with back boiler.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - c.5.4m x c.3.6m\nwith fitted kitchen, patio door to rear.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - c.3.3m x c.3.6m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - c.3.3m x c.3.9m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - c.2.6m x c.2.4m\n\n\nBathroom - c.1.9m x c.1.7m\nwith wc, whb, shower.\n\n"
      },
